{'symbol': 'REGN', 'date': '2022-04-14 07:00:00', 'title': 'U.S. FDA EXTENDS REVIEW OF BIOLOGICS LICENSE APPLICATION FOR REGEN-COV® (CASIRIVIMAB AND IMDEVIMAB) FOR TREATMENT AND PROPHYLAXIS OF COVID-19', 'text': 'REGENERON CONTINUES TO PROGRESS ITS NEXT GENERATION ANTIBODIES, AND HAS INITIATED A FIRST-IN-HUMAN TRIAL TARRYTOWN, N.Y. , APRIL 14, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- REGENERON PHARMACEUTICALS, INC. (NASDAQ: REGN) TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT THE U.S. FOOD AND DRUG ADMINISTRATION (FDA) HAS EXTENDED BY THREE MONTHS ITS REVIEW OF THE BIOLOGICS LICENSE APPLICATION (BLA) FOR REGEN-COV® (CASIRIVIMAB AND IMDEVIMAB) TO TREAT COVID-19 IN NON-HOSPITALIZED PATIENTS AND AS PROPHYLAXIS IN CERTAIN INDIVIDUALS.'}